{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SuffixStructures"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SuffixTree","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree.swift#L29","fileName":"SuffixTree.swift"},"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SuffixTree","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/Occurrence","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/SuffixLinksView-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/init(texts:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestCommonSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestRepeatedSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodeCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/nodes","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/root","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/textCount"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/children(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/edgeLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/isLeaf(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/occurrences(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/parent(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/pathLabel(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/stringDepth(of:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree"},"abstract":[{"text":"The suffix tree of one or more texts: the compressed trie of all their suffixes, built left to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"right in O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") (Ukkonen, “On-Line Construction of Suffix Trees”, 1995).","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuffixTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every suffix of every text ends at a leaf, the empty suffix included, and every internal node","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is a point where suffixes that agree so far go different ways, so the tree has at most 2","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" + 1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nodes. A pattern is found in O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":") steps down from the root, and the leaves below where it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends are its occurrences.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tree = SuffixTree(\"banana\")","tree.occurrences(of: \"ana\").map(\\.range)   \/\/ [3 ..< 6, 1 ..< 4]","tree.longestRepeatedSubstring?.range       \/\/ 3 ..< 6, \"ana\"","","let both = SuffixTree(texts: [\"xabxac\", \"abcabxabcd\"])","both.longestCommonSubstring                \/\/ text 1, 3 ..< 7: \"abxa\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Nodes are numbered in preorder from the root at 0, so a node’s subtree is the nodes from it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"just before the next node that is not its descendant. Children come in the order of the symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that starts their edge: sorted when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Symbol"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Comparable"},{"type":"text","text":", so the leaves are in the order of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their suffixes and match a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixArray","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of the same text; otherwise in the order the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"symbols first occur in the texts. Each text ends in a terminator of its own that sorts before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every symbol and belongs to no label."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tree converts to Grafluent’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and its suffix links are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a directed graph, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/suffixLinksView-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":". Each node takes 32 bytes and each symbol 4 more, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"texts’ codes, which the tree keeps."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://SuffixStructures/documentation/SuffixStructures/SuffixTree/longestCommonSubstring":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/suffixstructures\/suffixtree\/longestcommonsubstring","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"longestCommonSubstring"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV","text":"SuffixTree"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Symbol"},{"kind":"text","text":">."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16SuffixStructures0A4TreeV10OccurrenceV","text":"Occurrence"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixTree\/longestCommonSubstring","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The longest substring that occurs in every text, at its first occurrence in suffix order,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{